  "body": "Native, windowless `mesen-agent` command-line bundles for AI-driven emulation and debugging.\n\nThese assets contain the CLI and required runtime libraries only. They do not contain the Mesen GUI application.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Add native headless toolkit for AI emulator agents by @atonamy in https://github.com/atonamy/mesen-agent/pull/1\n* Fix debugger startup and step timing race by @atonamy in https://github.com/atonamy/mesen-agent/pull/2\n\n## New Contributors\n* @atonamy made their first contribution in https://github.com/atonamy/mesen-agent/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/atonamy/mesen-agent/compare/2.1.1...v0.1.0",
